# Who wrote what.
#
# Sadab-Munshi is the author of this project. Two noreply addresses that look
# like other people's were used by mistake: GitHub resolves a bare
# "<name>@users.noreply.github.com" to whichever account owns that name, and
# "sadab" belongs to a different account, which is why it appears in the
# contributors list. This file maps those commits back to the author in
# git log, git shortlog and git blame.
#
# It changes what git prints, and nothing else: no commit, no tag, no
# signature, no object in the repository is touched. The contributors list on
# GitHub is built from the author address in each commit, so it keeps showing
# the wrong account until the history itself is rewritten — which is a decision
# for the repository owner, not something to do quietly. See docs/AUTHORS.md.
Sadab-Munshi <237267786+Sadab-Munshi@users.noreply.github.com> Sadab Munshi <sadab@users.noreply.github.com>
Sadab-Munshi <237267786+Sadab-Munshi@users.noreply.github.com> Sadab Munshi <sadabmunshi@users.noreply.github.com>
